    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51739" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθελίσσω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειλίσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		aor.
		part.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειλίξας</span></b>  (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrap with bandages</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειλίσσουσι πᾶν τὸ σῶμα σινδόνος . .
				τελαμῶσι</span>, of mummies, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.86
			</span></i>; of wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.181
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματα σπαργάνοις καθειλίξαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					36.2
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; καττίτερον . . κατειλίξας ἐρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.204.32
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθελίξας</span>, 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατελλ-, κατελ-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς κνήμας ῥάκεσι . .
				κατειλίχατο</span> (3pl.
			plpf.) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειλίχθαι ταινίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρίοις . . καθείλικτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατελιχθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Mech.
					24.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a serpent,
				<i>drag down in its coils</i>, 
